        179.5
      ],
      "content": "BEFORE ME, a Notary Public for and in the Province of Isabela, personally appeared ADONIS A.\nASIS in his official capacity as District Engineer of the Department of Public Works and Highways,\nrepresenting the Republic of the Philippines, with PRC ID No. 0045170 issued on August 16, 1986 at\nManila and JOHN WINSTON D. UY in his official capacity as General Manager of JWU\nCONSTRUCTION AND SUPPLY with PCAB License No. 48659 with validity period up to October\n29, 2025 known to me and to me known to be the same persons who executed the foregoing\nCONTRACT AGREEMENT and they acknowledged to me same are their true act and deed for and\nbehalf of the parties they represent.\nThis Instrument consists of four (4) pages including this page on which the acknowledgment is\nwritten duly signed by the Contracting Parties and their witnesses on the left margin of the other\npages.",
